- Zhuxin (Mage): +3.7 pp edge. Across Hylos's measured matchups, Hylos is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Zhuxin before Hylos can scale.
- Kimmy (Marksman/Mage): +3.3 pp edge. Across Hylos's measured matchups, Hylos is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Kimmy before Hylos can scale.
- Yve (Mage): +3.1 pp edge. Yve has a statistical edge over Hylos based on ranked matchup data. Pick Yve to gain an advantage in draft.
- Cici (Fighter): +3.0 pp edge. Across Hylos's measured matchups, Hylos is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Cici before Hylos can scale.
- Karrie (Marksman): +2.9 pp edge. Hylos is countered by high mobility heroes like Karrie and Lesley, as they are hard for him to lock down and can also take him out.
- Rafaela (Support): +2.3 pp edge. Across Hylos's measured matchups, Hylos is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Rafaela before Hylos can scale.
- Xavier (Mage): +1.9 pp edge. Across Hylos's measured matchups, Hylos is weakest in the early game. Apply pressure with Xavier before Hylos can scale.

