## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Mana Wall (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Clock of Destiny, Cursed Helmet, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Clock of Destiny, Cursed Helmet, Dominance Ice
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Guardian Helmet over Oracle when Use when repeated siege resets matter more than amplifying Glorious Pathway's self-heal.; Radiant Armor over Oracle when Use against repeated magic ticks that keep hitting Hylos after he walks through the first control chain.; Antique Cuirass over Oracle when Use when physical skill burst is deleting Hylos before his Vengeance window finishes.; Conceal over Encourage when Use as the roam blessing when your team needs hidden Pathway angles instead of grouped stat sharing.
- Total cost: 10630 gold

Default roam setup that converts Clock's mana into extra HP, then uses aura damage and Dominance Ice to hold front-to-back fights.

### Roam Conceal Pathway (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Guardian Helmet, Radiant Armor, Immortality
- Core: Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Guardian Helmet
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Pull Yourself Together, Focusing Mark
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Clock of Destiny over Guardian Helmet when Use when the game will slow down and Hylos can cash mana into HP before Lord fights.; Antique Cuirass over Radiant Armor when Use against physical assassins or EXP bruisers whose skill burst decides the first contact.; Blade Armor over Radiant Armor when Use when a basic-attack marksman must keep hitting Hylos during the Pathway collapse.; Encourage over Conceal when Use as the roam blessing when your team groups early and does not need stealth to force entry.
- Total cost: 11030 gold

Tempo roam setup for coordinated picks, using Conceal, Pathway, Flicker, and Focusing Mark to carry allies into the same target.

### Jungle HP Burn (Jungle)

- Items: Tough Boots, Cursed Helmet, Clock of Destiny, Thunder Belt, Dominance Ice, Guardian Helmet
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Clock of Destiny, Thunder Belt
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Seasoned Hunter, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Retribution
- Blessing: Bloody Retribution
- Flex: Ice Retribution over Bloody Retribution when Use when stealing movement speed is more valuable than another HP swing on the enemy frontliner.; Immortality over Guardian Helmet when Use when one death before Lord decides the game and Hylos must buy a second body.; Radiant Armor over Guardian Helmet when Use against double magic damage or repeated poke that prevents Hylos from staying in the pit.; Antique Cuirass over Guardian Helmet when Use when the enemy jungler is a physical skill diver who bursts before Thunder Belt stacks matter.
- Total cost: 10970 gold

Jungle variant that clears through Cursed Helmet, scales HP through Clock, and turns long objective fights into repeated Thunder Belt procs.

